---
---

<section class="field section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow field__eyebrow">IN THE FIELD</p>
    <h2 class="section-title field__title">Run together. Proven together.</h2>
    <p class="field__body">
      Operator-grade systems built in the field, not in a classroom. I built them on real jobs: Frame TVs, mantel mounts, porcelain tile walls, and cables run inside the wall. The Mounting Man's results are operator proof, not a promise of your results.
    </p>
    <div class="field__strip">
      <div class="field__card field__card--wide">
        <span class="field__card-label">Twin Cities</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field__card">
        <span class="field__card-label">Frame</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field__card">
        <span class="field__card-label">Mantel</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field__card">
        <span class="field__card-label">Porcelain</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field__card">
        <span class="field__card-label">In-wall cable</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .field {
    background: var(--black);
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .field__eyebrow {
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .field__title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .field__body {
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .field__strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .field__card {
    min-height: 120px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }

  .field__card--wide {
    min-height: 160px;
  }

  .field__card-label {
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-on-dark);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .field__strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .field__card--wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
  }
</style>
